### ==========================================
### Elasticsearch API Examples
### ==========================================

### Check cluster health
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/_cluster/health

### Check cluster info
GET http://elasticsearch:9200

### List all indices
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/_cat/indices?v

### ==========================================
### Index Management
### ==========================================

### Create an index for application logs
PUT http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "settings": {
        "number_of_shards": 1,
        "number_of_replicas": 0
    },
    "mappings": {
        "properties": {
            "timestamp": { "type": "date" },
            "level": { "type": "keyword" },
            "service": { "type": "keyword" },
            "message": { "type": "text" },
            "request_id": { "type": "keyword" },
            "duration_ms": { "type": "integer" }
        }
    }
}

### ==========================================
### Indexing Documents
### ==========================================

### Index a log entry
POST http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_doc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
    "level": "INFO",
    "service": "api-gateway",
    "message": "Request processed successfully",
    "request_id": "req-12345",
    "duration_ms": 45
}

### Index an error log
POST http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_doc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:31:00Z",
    "level": "ERROR",
    "service": "user-service",
    "message": "Database connection failed: timeout after 30s",
    "request_id": "req-12346",
    "duration_ms": 30000
}

### Index a warning log
POST http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_doc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:32:00Z",
    "level": "WARN",
    "service": "api-gateway",
    "message": "Rate limit approaching threshold",
    "request_id": "req-12347",
    "duration_ms": 12
}

### ==========================================
### Searching
### ==========================================

### Search all logs
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": {
        "match_all": {}
    },
    "sort": [
        { "timestamp": "desc" }
    ]
}

### Search for errors only
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": {
        "term": {
            "level": "ERROR"
        }
    }
}

### Full-text search in messages
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": {
        "match": {
            "message": "database connection"
        }
    }
}

### Aggregation: count by log level
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "size": 0,
    "aggs": {
        "logs_by_level": {
            "terms": {
                "field": "level"
            }
        }
    }
}

### Aggregation: average duration by service
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "size": 0,
    "aggs": {
        "by_service": {
            "terms": {
                "field": "service"
            },
            "aggs": {
                "avg_duration": {
                    "avg": {
                        "field": "duration_ms"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

### ==========================================
### Logstash Indices (created by pipeline)
### ==========================================

### List logstash indices
GET http://elasticsearch:9200/logstash-*/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": {
        "match_all": {}
    }
}

### ==========================================
### Cleanup
### ==========================================

### Delete app-logs index
DELETE http://elasticsearch:9200/app-logs
